; Analyzer severities for the sample tree.
;
; samples/Directory.Build.props wires the customer-facing Reactor.Analyzers
; bundle into every sample (samples are consumer code, so consumer rules apply;
; src/Reactor deliberately opts out because they would fire on framework
; internals). Turning that on surfaced 342 pre-existing warnings, almost all of
; them accessibility and theming debt that predates the analyzer wiring and is
; unrelated to whatever change enabled it.
;
; Rather than hide the wiring or dump 342 warnings into every sample build, the
; high-volume debt rules are downgraded to `suggestion` here: still visible in
; the IDE and to `mur check`, silent in build output. The correctness-class
; rules -- REACTOR_EVENT_001 (imperative event wiring that re-subscribes every
; render), REACTOR_POOL_001 / REACTOR_VIS_001 (.Set writes lost on pool reuse),
; REACTOR_THEME_003, REACTOR_ITEMS_001, REACTOR_CTRL_001 -- are deliberately
; left at their default warning severity, because those indicate real bugs.
;
; The REACTOR_HOOKS_* rules are correctness rules too -- a hook called outside
; Render, or inside a nested lambda, breaks the call-order contract that hook
; state depends on. They are NOT downgraded globally for that reason. All 112
; existing violations live in the 22 files listed at the bottom of this file, so
; the downgrade is scoped to exactly those: a hook bug in any other sample, or
; in a new one, still fails the build.
;
; Each entry below is debt to burn down, not an accepted permanent exemption.
; Remove a line once its rule is clean across samples.
;
; Current counts at the time of writing (full rebuild of Reactor.slnx):
;   REACTOR_THEME_001  254   hardcoded colors instead of Theme tokens
;   REACTOR_A11Y_003   184   form fields need header / AutomationName / LabeledBy
;   REACTOR_A11Y_001    74   icon-only buttons need AutomationName
;   REACTOR_HOOKS_001   42   hook called outside Render / custom-hook method
;   REACTOR_DSL_001     36   Select(...) element without .WithKey(...)
;   REACTOR_HOOKS_013   32   hook called inside a nested lambda / local function
;   REACTOR_HOOKS_005   24   control cached instead of going through the ref
;   REACTOR_A11Y_002     8   images need AutomationName / AccessibilityHidden
;   REACTOR_HOOKS_011    8   freshly-allocated initial value re-evaluated per render
;   REACTOR_HOOKS_004    6   freshly-allocated deps compare unequal every render
;   REACTOR_THEME_004    6   inline SolidColorBrush instead of a token
;   REACTOR_GRID_001     4   Grid declares a track with no child in it
;   REACTOR_A11Y_004     2   clickable container not keyboard-reachable
;
; REACTOR_NAV_001 is deliberately absent: it had exactly one violation, a
; test-only static navigation handle in ReactorCharting.Gallery, so it is
; suppressed at that line with a justification instead. A tree-wide downgrade
; would have hidden every future one.

[*.cs]
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_THEME_001.severity = suggestion
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_THEME_004.severity = suggestion
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_A11Y_001.severity = suggestion
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_A11Y_002.severity = suggestion
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_A11Y_003.severity = suggestion
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_A11Y_004.severity = suggestion
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_DSL_001.severity = suggestion
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_GRID_001.severity = suggestion

; Hook-rule debt, scoped to the files that already carry it. Deliberately a file
; list and not a `**/*.cs` glob: a new violation anywhere else still breaks the
; build, which is the point of keeping these rules at warning. Delete a path once
; its file is clean; delete the whole section once the list is empty.
[{CommandingDemo/App.cs,TodoApp/Program.cs,ReactorHostControlDemo/MainWindow.xaml.cs,ReactorGallery/ControlPages/Navigation/BreadcrumbBarPage.cs,Reactor.TestApp/Demos/CommandingDemo.cs,Reactor.TestApp/Demos/DataGridDemo.cs,Reactor.TestApp/Demos/InputGesturesDemo.cs,Reactor.TestApp/Demos/IntegratedDataDemo.cs,Reactor.TestApp/Demos/MemoDemo.cs,Reactor.TestApp/Demos/PropertyGridDemo.cs,Reactor.TestApp/Demos/TransitionsDemo.cs,ReactorCharting.Gallery/Samples/AnimatedDonut.cs,ReactorCharting.Gallery/Samples/BarChartRace.cs,ReactorCharting.Gallery/Samples/CurveExplorer.cs,ReactorCharting.Gallery/Samples/DonutMixer.cs,apps/chat/App/ChatSampleApp.cs,apps/demo-script-tool/App/Components/StepCard.cs,apps/headtrax/HeadTrax/App.cs,apps/reactor-ide/App.cs,apps/regedit/App.cs,apps/regedit/Components/Dialogs/ExportDialog.cs,apps/widget-creator/WidgetCreatorShell.cs}]
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_HOOKS_001.severity = suggestion
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_HOOKS_004.severity = suggestion
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_HOOKS_005.severity = suggestion
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_HOOKS_011.severity = suggestion
dotnet_diagnostic.REACTOR_HOOKS_013.severity = suggestion

